# File product classification (keep in sync with PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md):
# - binary/runtime: *.db, *.db-wal, *.db-shm, data/*.db -> ignore
# - runtime caches: batch_scan_latest.json, discover_latest.json, scan_history/, discover_history/, backups/ -> ignore
# - research/ledger to commit: data/_exp*.json, references/probe_*.py, pool_maintenance_log.jsonl -> tracked
# - deprecated research artifacts keep _deprecated_YYYYMMDD suffix and register in BASELINE_LEDGER.deprecated_intermediates

